flowchart TD
    A[User navigates to /admin/*] --> B{AdminRoute:<br/>sessionStorage has<br/>aw_admin_token?}

    B -- No --> C[Redirect to /admin/login]
    B -- Yes --> D[Render protected page<br/>AdminConsole / AdminTenantDetail / AdminAdmins]

    D --> E[Page useEffect checks<br/>sessionStorage token again]
    E -- No token --> C

    E -- Token present --> F[Page calls adminFetch<br/>GET /api/v1/internal/...]

    F --> G{Response status?}

    G -- 401 Unauthorized --> H[logout: clear sessionStorage<br/>aw_admin_token + aw_admin_info]
    H --> C

    G -- Other error --> I[Show error message<br/>to admin user]

    G -- 200 OK --> J[Parse JSON response]
    J --> K[Render data<br/>tenants / billing / admins]

    style C fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#991b1b
    style K fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#166534
    style H fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#92400e
